{"id": "S0001", "offset": 0, "section": "abstract", "text": "摘要"}
{"id": "S0002", "offset": 3, "section": "abstract", "text": "本文提出一种快速脱水工艺，使果蔬干制品的复水率提高 65%，能耗降低 20%。"}
{"id": "S0003", "offset": 42, "section": "abstract", "text": "结果见表2。"}
{"id": "S0004", "offset": 48, "section": "abstract", "text": "本工艺采用 VRF 控制系统实现温度闭环。"}
{"id": "S0005", "offset": 71, "section": "introduction", "text": "引言"}
{"id": "S0006", "offset": 74, "section": "introduction", "text": "果蔬脱水能耗高、品质差。"}
{"id": "S0007", "offset": 86, "section": "introduction", "text": "本文将分析热风—真空耦合工艺的能耗特征，并回答复水率与能耗的权衡关系。"}
{"id": "S0008", "offset": 121, "section": "introduction", "text": "本文将建立脱水过程的动力学模型。"}
{"id": "S0009", "offset": 137, "section": "introduction", "text": "VRF 系统在全流程中的稳定性也将被评估。"}
{"id": "S0010", "offset": 160, "section": "methods", "text": "方法"}
{"id": "S0011", "offset": 163, "section": "methods", "text": "热风温度 60°C，真空度 -0.08 MPa。"}
{"id": "S0012", "offset": 187, "section": "methods", "text": "每组 4 个样本，测量复水率与能耗。"}
{"id": "S0013", "offset": 207, "section": "results", "text": "结果"}
{"id": "S0014", "offset": 210, "section": "results", "text": "复水率由 2.1 提高至 3.0，相对提升 43%。"}
{"id": "S0015", "offset": 236, "section": "results", "text": "能耗由 5.2 降至 4.4 kWh/kg，降低 15%。"}
{"id": "S0016", "offset": 267, "section": "discussion", "text": "讨论"}
{"id": "S0017", "offset": 270, "section": "discussion", "text": "复水率的提升主要来自真空阶段的细胞通道扩张。"}
{"id": "S0018", "offset": 292, "section": "discussion", "text": "VRF 系统运行平稳。"}
{"id": "S0019", "offset": 305, "section": "discussion", "text": "表1 不同工艺段的能耗分布。"}
{"id": "S0020", "offset": 321, "section": "references", "text": "参考文献"}
{"id": "S0021", "offset": 326, "section": "references", "text": "[1] 刘 et al., 果蔬干燥, 2017."}
